Package: gfcrisk
Title: Market Risk of Ten S&P 500 Stocks Before and During the 2007-09 Crisis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("David", "Dümig", email = "41909992+duemig@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions and scripts behind the study of value-at-risk, expected
    shortfall and tail dependence for a portfolio of ten S&P 500 stocks across
    the 2007-09 financial crisis. Provides static and rolling VaR and ES
    estimators (historical, normal, EWMA, GARCH(1,1)-t, filtered historical
    simulation), VaR and ES backtests, stressed VaR, and copula fits.
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    copula,
    GGally,
    ggplot2,
    PerformanceAnalytics,
    scales,
    xts,
    zoo
Suggests:
    knitr,
    quantmod,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
